{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/8/1482e9f09344b23a4295a6b1eed7d7a838aed311.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 0, y &gt; 0, x &gt; y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"146\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/a/bca276ee5cda7e0542c4df40f897300c098e1718.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />. The inequality which is not always correct is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/8/2c8333cb79028fe940a5b33295a0160441313e0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x + z &gt; y + z \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ x - z &gt; y - z \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ xz &gt; yz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"445\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb1058d4e31c1c4c78ba60e271ffd93ecc05714d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac {x}{z^2} &gt; \\frac {y}{z^2} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ xz^2 &gt; yz^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"243\" height=\"33\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/b/24b465e001119542c17876d5a0f3d3ba58e6fd7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x + z &gt; y + z\\implies x&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"235\" height=\"17\" />, just subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> from both sides\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/5686c39247ccba8d6b1d5c147af87c2e8d593149.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ x - z &gt; y - z\\implies x&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"234\" height=\"17\" />, just add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to both sides\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f430af47d09216bcbe8b90d736df4e6f9abf7b67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ xz &gt; yz\\implies x&gt;y\\text{ if }x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"254\" height=\"17\" />, so that means that our desired answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c52c7445b490f73f2208f893759cb5caaf91a6de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ xz &gt; yz}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" />. \n</p><p>As a check:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/46541b9296b141dfcacf45f1769688d25ecdd1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac {x}{z^2} &gt; \\frac {y}{z^2}\\implies x&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"196\" height=\"34\" />, we can divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c3b0b966fdafe902c6375ebef2b7fa9fdc4d223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> safely and without worry because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c67c49acbe517cfac3a971088a806b8f5bcbf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e01a54dc6147341e8175afcd73f289d61c696d0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ xz^2 &gt; yz^2\\implies x&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"203\" height=\"19\" />, similar reasoning as above but instead, multiply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c3b0b966fdafe902c6375ebef2b7fa9fdc4d223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wik